   "source": [
    "## 1 量化基础\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.1 为什么量化？\n",
    "\n",
    "现代大模型参数量以十亿计，FP16 存储下每十亿参数需要约 2 GB 显存。INT8 将每个参数压缩到 1 字节，直接节省 2× 存储；INT4 节省 4×。更低的位宽还意味着更小的访存压力——在推理场景中，注意力层往往是 **访存受限（memory-bound）** 的，访存量的减少可以直接转化为更高的吞吐量。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.2 均匀量化的数学定义\n",
    "\n",
    "最常见的量化方案是**均匀量化**，将浮点值 $x \\in [x_{\\min}, x_{\\max}]$ 映射到整数网格 $[q_{\\min}, q_{\\max}]$：\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "q = \\operatorname{clip}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{round}\\!\\left(\\frac{x}{s}\\right) + z,\\; q_{\\min},\\; q_{\\max}\\right)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "其中 $s$（**scale**）为量化步长，$z$（**zero-point**）为整数零点。**反量化**：\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\hat{x} = s \\cdot (q - z)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "量化误差 $\\epsilon = x - \\hat{x}$ 由两部分组成：舍入误差（上界 $s/2$）和截断误差（超出 $[x_{\\min},x_{\\max}]$ 的部分被 clip 截断）。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.3 对称量化 vs 非对称量化\n",
    "\n",
    "| | 对称量化 | 非对称量化 |\n",
    "|--|----------|------------|\n",
    "| zero-point | $z = 0$ | $z \\neq 0$ |\n",
    "| scale | $s = \\max(|x_{\\min}|,|x_{\\max}|)/127$ | $s = (x_{\\max}-x_{\\min})/255$ |\n",
    "| 优势 | 推理时无需处理 $z$，计算更简单 | 对非对称分布（如 ReLU 输出）利用率更高 |\n",
    "| 典型用途 | 权重（分布近似对称） | 激活值（可能存在偏移） |\n",
    "\n",
    "### 1.4 INT8 / FP8 简介\n",
    "\n",
    "| 格式 | 位宽 | 典型应用 |\n",
    "|------|------|----------|\n",
    "| INT8 | 8 bit | 推理加速（TensorRT、bitsandbytes） |\n",
    "| FP8 E4M3 | 8 bit | 训练前向（H100 原生支持） |\n",
    "| FP8 E5M2 | 8 bit | 训练梯度（动态范围更大） |\n",
    "| INT4 | 4 bit | 超低比特推理（GPTQ、AWQ） |\n",
    "\n",
    "本节以 **INT8** 为主线，并在误差分析中与 INT4 横向对比。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "fa04_sec1_quant_fn",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── 均匀量化核心函数 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "\n",
    "def compute_scale_zp_symmetric(x: torch.Tensor, bits: int = 8):\n",
    "    \"\"\"对称量化：z=0，scale 由最大绝对值决定。\"\"\"\n",
    "    q_max = 2 ** (bits - 1) - 1          # INT8 → 127\n",
    "    x_abs_max = x.abs().max().item()\n",
    "    if x_abs_max == 0:\n",
    "        return 1.0, 0\n",
    "    return x_abs_max / q_max, 0\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def compute_scale_zp_asymmetric(x: torch.Tensor, bits: int = 8):\n",
    "    \"\"\"非对称量化：利用 [x_min, x_max] 全范围。\"\"\"\n",
    "    q_min = -(2 ** (bits - 1))           # INT8 → -128\n",
    "    q_max =  (2 ** (bits - 1)) - 1       # INT8 →  127\n",
    "    x_min, x_max = x.min().item(), x.max().item()\n",
    "    if x_max == x_min:\n",
    "        return 1.0, 0\n",
    "    scale = (x_max - x_min) / (q_max - q_min)\n",
    "    zp = int(round(q_min - x_min / scale))\n",
    "    zp = max(q_min, min(q_max, zp))\n",
    "    return scale, zp\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def fake_quantize(x: torch.Tensor, bits: int = 8,\n",
    "                  symmetric: bool = True) -> tuple:\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    模拟量化（Fake Quantization）：量化后立即反量化，\n",
    "    保持浮点格式但引入量化误差。返回 (x_hat, scale, zero_point)。\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    q_min = -(2 ** (bits - 1))\n",
    "    q_max =  (2 ** (bits - 1)) - 1\n",
    "    if symmetric:\n",
    "        s, z = compute_scale_zp_symmetric(x, bits)\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        s, z = compute_scale_zp_asymmetric(x, bits)\n",
    "    q = torch.clamp(torch.round(x / s + z), q_min, q_max)\n",
    "    x_hat = s * (q - z)\n",
    "    return x_hat.to(x.dtype), s, z\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── 基本验证 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "torch.manual_seed(0)\n",
    "x_demo = torch.randn(4, 8)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=== 对称 INT8 量化演示 ===\")\n",
    "x_hat_sym, s_sym, z_sym = fake_quantize(x_demo, bits=8, symmetric=True)\n",
    "err_sym = (x_demo - x_hat_sym).abs()\n",
    "print(f\"scale={s_sym:.5f}, zero_point={z_sym}\")\n",
    "print(f\"最大误差: {err_sym.max():.5f}   均值误差: {err_sym.mean():.5f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"理论上界 s/2: {s_sym/2:.5f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== 非对称分布（ReLU 输出）：对称 vs 非对称量化 ===\")\n",
    "x_pos = torch.relu(torch.randn(64, 64))\n",
    "x_hat_a, s_a, z_a = fake_quantize(x_pos, bits=8, symmetric=False)\n",
    "x_hat_s, s_s, _   = fake_quantize(x_pos, bits=8, symmetric=True)\n",
    "print(f\"非对称: scale={s_a:.5f}, zp={z_a:4d}, 最大误差={( x_pos - x_hat_a).abs().max():.5f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"对称  : scale={s_s:.5f}, zp={0:4d}, 最大误差={(x_pos - x_hat_s).abs().max():.5f}\")\n",
    "print(\"→ 对非负激活，非对称量化覆盖范围更精准，误差更小。\")"
   ]
  },
