   "source": [
    "## 3 逐张量 vs 逐通道量化\n",
    "\n",
    "量化的**粒度**（Granularity）决定了 scale 和 zero-point 的计算范围，是精度与效率的核心权衡：\n",
    "\n",
    "| 粒度 | 每个 scale 覆盖范围 | 参数开销 | 精度 | 硬件友好度 |\n",
    "|------|---------------------|----------|------|------------|\n",
    "| 逐张量（per-tensor） | 整个张量共享一个 $s,z$ | 最低（1 对） | 最低 | 最高（INT8 gemm 直接支持） |\n",
    "| 逐通道（per-channel） | 每个输出通道独立 $s,z$ | 中等（$C_{out}$ 对） | 较高 | 良好（大多数库支持） |\n",
    "| 逐行（per-token / per-row） | 每行/每 token 独立 | 较高（$N$ 对） | 高 | 较低（需动态计算） |\n",
    "| 逐元素（per-element） | 每个值独立 | 最高（等于元素数） | 最高 | 不可行 |\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3.1 为什么逐通道量化对权重效果好？\n",
    "\n",
    "线性层权重 $W \\in \\mathbb{R}^{C_{out} \\times C_{in}}$ 的不同输出通道（行）方差往往差异显著。逐张量量化用单一 scale 覆盖所有通道，导致方差小的通道有效比特数大幅减少：\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\text{有效比特数} \\approx \\log_2\\!\\left(\\frac{\\sigma_{\\max}}{\\sigma_k}\\right) + 8\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "若某通道方差仅为最大方差的 1/16，有效精度损失约 4 bit——相当于退化到 INT4。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3.2 激活值的动态量化\n",
    "\n",
    "激活值（$Q$、$K$、$V$ 的运行时值）分布随输入变化，无法离线固定 scale。**动态量化**（Dynamic Quantization）在每次推理时实时计算 scale：\n",
    "\n",
    "```python\n",
    "# 每次前向传播时计算\n",
    "scale = x.abs().max() / 127.0\n",
    "x_int8 = (x / scale).round().clamp(-128, 127).to(torch.int8)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "开销：额外的 max 规约操作（对 $N \\times d$ 的张量约为 $O(Nd)$），相对于矩阵乘的 $O(N^2d)$ 可忽略不计。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "fa04_sec3_granularity",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── 逐张量 vs 逐通道量化：精度对比 ───────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "\n",
    "def per_tensor_fake_quantize(W: torch.Tensor, bits: int = 8) -> torch.Tensor:\n",
    "    \"\"\"逐张量对称量化。\"\"\"\n",
    "    x_hat, _, _ = fake_quantize(W, bits=bits, symmetric=True)\n",
    "    return x_hat\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "def per_channel_fake_quantize(W: torch.Tensor, bits: int = 8,\n",
    "                               dim: int = 0) -> torch.Tensor:\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    逐通道对称量化：沿 dim 维度（输出通道）分别计算 scale。\n",
    "    W shape: (C_out, C_in) → 每行独立量化。\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    W_hat = torch.zeros_like(W)\n",
    "    for i in range(W.shape[dim]):\n",
    "        row = W[i] if dim == 0 else W[:, i]\n",
    "        row_hat, _, _ = fake_quantize(row, bits=bits, symmetric=True)\n",
    "        if dim == 0:\n",
    "            W_hat[i] = row_hat\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            W_hat[:, i] = row_hat\n",
    "    return W_hat\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 构造具有异构通道方差的权重矩阵（模拟真实 MHA 投影层）\n",
    "torch.manual_seed(7)\n",
    "C_out, C_in = 256, 64\n",
    "# 不同通道方差差异大：前 64 通道方差大，后 64 方差小\n",
    "W_test = torch.zeros(C_out, C_in)\n",
    "for i in range(C_out):\n",
    "    sigma = 2.0 if i < C_out // 4 else (0.5 if i < C_out // 2 else\n",
    "            (0.2 if i < 3 * C_out // 4 else 0.05))\n",
    "    W_test[i] = torch.randn(C_in) * sigma\n",
    "\n",
    "W_pt = per_tensor_fake_quantize(W_test, bits=8)\n",
    "W_pc = per_channel_fake_quantize(W_test, bits=8, dim=0)\n",
    "\n",
    "err_pt = (W_test - W_pt).abs()\n",
    "err_pc = (W_test - W_pc).abs()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=== 逐张量 vs 逐通道 INT8 量化误差 ===\")\n",
    "print(f\"{'方案':>12}  {'最大误差':>10}  {'均值误差':>10}  {'相对误差(%)':>12}\")\n",
    "print(\"-\" * 50)\n",
    "w_norm = W_test.abs().mean().item()\n",
    "for name, err in [(\"逐张量\", err_pt), (\"逐通道\", err_pc)]:\n",
    "    print(f\"{name:>12}  {err.max():>10.5f}  {err.mean():>10.5f}  \"\n",
    "          f\"{err.mean()/w_norm*100:>12.2f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 按通道显示误差分布\n",
    "err_pt_per_ch = err_pt.mean(dim=1).numpy()\n",
    "err_pc_per_ch = err_pc.mean(dim=1).numpy()\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(13, 4))\n",
    "ch_idx = np.arange(C_out)\n",
    "axes[0].bar(ch_idx, err_pt_per_ch, color=\"tomato\", alpha=0.7, label=\"逐张量\")\n",
    "axes[0].bar(ch_idx, err_pc_per_ch, color=\"steelblue\", alpha=0.7, label=\"逐通道\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"输出通道 index\"); axes[0].set_ylabel(\"均值绝对误差\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"各通道量化误差（逐张量 vs 逐通道）\")\n",
    "axes[0].legend(); axes[0].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 通道方差 vs 逐张量误差的相关性\n",
    "ch_std = W_test.std(dim=1).numpy()\n",
    "axes[1].scatter(ch_std, err_pt_per_ch, alpha=0.5, s=10, color=\"tomato\", label=\"逐张量误差\")\n",
    "axes[1].scatter(ch_std, err_pc_per_ch, alpha=0.5, s=10, color=\"steelblue\", label=\"逐通道误差\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"通道标准差\"); axes[1].set_ylabel(\"均值绝对误差\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"通道方差 vs 量化误差\")\n",
    "axes[1].legend(); axes[1].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"../results/04_granularity.png\", dpi=120, bbox_inches=\"tight\")\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "print(\"图像已保存至 results/04_granularity.png\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n结论：逐通道量化对方差小的通道误差大幅更低；逐张量量化在通道方差差异大时精度损失明显。\")"
