   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fa04_sec6_title",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6 量化感知训练（QAT）简介\n",
    "\n",
    "PTQ 在少量校准数据下快速完成量化，但对于精度敏感的任务（如低资源语言翻译、代码生成），INT8 PTQ 的精度损失可能无法接受，尤其是 INT4 以下。**量化感知训练（QAT）** 通过在训练过程中模拟量化误差，让模型学会在量化约束下保持精度。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6.1 Straight-Through Estimator（STE）\n",
    "\n",
    "量化函数 $q = \\text{round}(x/s)$ 的梯度几乎处处为 0，无法直接用于反向传播。STE 的做法是在反向传播时将 round 的梯度**近似为 1**（"直通"）：\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial x} \\approx \\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial \\hat{x}} \\cdot \\mathbf{1}\\![q_{\\min} \\leq x/s \\leq q_{\\max}]\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "clip 区间外的梯度置零（硬阈值），区间内梯度直接传递。\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6.2 QAT 训练流程\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "FP32 预训练模型\n",
    "        │\n",
    "        ▼\n",
    "插入 FakeQuantize 节点（每个量化目标张量后）\n",
    "        │\n",
    "        ▼\n",
    "正常训练（前向用 FakeQuantize 模拟误差，反向用 STE）\n",
    "        │\n",
    "        ▼\n",
    "收敛后移除 FakeQuantize 节点，导出真实 INT8 模型\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### 6.3 PTQ vs QAT 对比\n",
    "\n",
    "| | PTQ | QAT |\n",
    "|--|-----|-----|\n",
    "| 是否需要训练 | 否 | 是（通常微调 1–10% 原始训练步数） |\n",
    "| 校准数据 | 少量（128–512 样本） | 完整训练集 |\n",
    "| 精度 | 良好（INT8）/ 下降（INT4） | 优秀，可恢复大部分精度损失 |\n",
    "| 适用场景 | 快速部署、精度要求一般 | 精度敏感、低比特（INT4 以下）|\n",
    "| 典型工具 | `torch.quantization`、TensorRT | `torch.ao.quantization.qat`、QLoRA |"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "fa04_sec6_ste",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ── STE 自定义 autograd Function 实现 ────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "\n",
    "class FakeQuantizeSTE(torch.autograd.Function):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Straight-Through Estimator（STE）的模拟量化实现。\n",
    "    前向：执行均匀量化后反量化（引入量化误差）。\n",
    "    反向：clip 范围内梯度直通（≈1），范围外梯度为 0。\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    @staticmethod\n",
    "    def forward(ctx, x: torch.Tensor, scale: float,\n",
    "                bits: int = 8) -> torch.Tensor:\n",
    "        q_min = -(2 ** (bits - 1))\n",
    "        q_max =  (2 ** (bits - 1)) - 1\n",
    "        # 保存 clip 掩码，用于反向传播\n",
    "        x_scaled = x / scale\n",
    "        ctx.save_for_backward(\n",
    "            (x_scaled >= q_min) & (x_scaled <= q_max)\n",
    "        )\n",
    "        q = torch.clamp(torch.round(x_scaled), q_min, q_max)\n",
    "        return q * scale  # 反量化（对称，z=0）\n",
    "\n",
    "    @staticmethod\n",
    "    def backward(ctx, grad_output: torch.Tensor):\n",
    "        (in_range,) = ctx.saved_tensors\n",
    "        # STE：在 clip 范围内梯度直通，范围外梯度为 0\n",
    "        grad_input = grad_output * in_range.float()\n",
    "        return grad_input, None, None  # 对 x, scale, bits 的梯度\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "fake_quant_ste = FakeQuantizeSTE.apply\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── 验证 STE 梯度 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "torch.manual_seed(3)\n",
    "x_ste = torch.randn(8, 8, requires_grad=True)\n",
    "scale_ste = x_ste.abs().max().item() / 127.0\n",
    "\n",
    "x_q_ste = fake_quant_ste(x_ste, scale_ste, 8)\n",
    "loss_ste = x_q_ste.sum()\n",
    "loss_ste.backward()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=== STE 梯度验证 ===\")\n",
    "print(f\"输入中 clip 范围内元素比例: \"\n",
    "      f\"{(x_ste.abs() <= 127 * scale_ste).float().mean():.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"梯度非零元素比例: \"\n",
    "      f\"{(x_ste.grad.abs() > 0).float().mean():.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"梯度最大值: {x_ste.grad.abs().max():.4f}（应为 1.0，STE 直通）\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# ── 演示 QAT 风格的训练循环（极简版）────────────────────────────────────────\n",
    "print(\"\\n=== QAT 风格训练演示（1 层 Linear，10 步）===\")\n",
    "torch.manual_seed(0)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 目标：学习 y = 2x + 1（用 QAT 训练一个量化线性层）\n",
    "linear_qat = nn.Linear(4, 1)\n",
    "optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(linear_qat.parameters(), lr=0.01)\n",
    "\n",
    "for step in range(20):\n",
    "    x_qat = torch.randn(32, 4)\n",
    "    y_target = (x_qat * 2).sum(dim=1, keepdim=True) + 1.0\n",
    "\n",
    "    # QAT 前向：对权重施加 FakeQuantize（STE）\n",
    "    w_scale = linear_qat.weight.abs().max().item() / 127.0\n",
    "    w_q = fake_quant_ste(linear_qat.weight, w_scale, 8)\n",
    "    y_pred = F.linear(x_qat, w_q, linear_qat.bias)\n",
    "\n",
    "    loss = F.mse_loss(y_pred, y_target)\n",
    "    optimizer.zero_grad()\n",
    "    loss.backward()\n",
    "    optimizer.step()\n",
    "\n",
    "    if (step + 1) % 5 == 0:\n",
    "        print(f\"  步骤 {step+1:3d}: loss={loss.item():.4f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"✓ STE 梯度正常传播，QAT 训练循环可收敛。\")"
   ]
  },
